s='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>Microduck — three versions compared</title><style>body{font:16px/1.6 system-ui;color:#193444;margin:0;background:#eff3f5}main{max-width:1320px;margin:auto;padding:35px}h1{font-size:36px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;background:white}th,td{padding:15px;border:1px solid #ccd7dd;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{background:#dfeaf0}td:first-child{width:15%;font-weight:600}td{width:28%}.card{padding:24px;background:white;margin:24px 0;border-radius:12px}.key{border-left:6px solid #00869b}a{color:#00708b}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media print{main{padding:0}body{background:white}tr,.card{break-inside:avoid}h2{break-after:avoid}}</style><main><a href="START HERE.html">← Cable guide / 返回线缆指南</a><h1>Which Microduck are we reviewing?<br>我们在比较哪一种Microduck？</h1><div class="card key"><b>Our current version still uses fifteen XL330-M288-T servos.</b><p>No cheaper motor has been substituted. The community replica and the commercial original are separate references; none of these records proves our version is a 1:1 copy.</p><p><b>当前版本仍采用15个XL330-M288-T舵机，没有换成廉价舵机。</b>社区复刻和商业原版是两个不同参考；这些资料不能证明我们的版本是1:1复制。</p></div><table><thead><tr><th>Topic / 项目</th><th>Our ce-cad version / 我们的版本</th><th>Community replica / 社区复刻</th><th>Commercial original / 商业原版</th></tr></thead><tbody>'''
