s+='''</tbody></table><h2>The cheaper-servo route / 更便宜舵机的路线</h2><div class="card"><p><b>Feetech HD-1910-C001 is a candidate, not a drop-in replacement or a purchase decision.</b> It needs its own reviewed revision. Validate mounting holes, horn/spline and clearances; supply voltage, connectors and pin order; bus protocol and driver; torque-speed behavior, backlash and calibration; and walking-policy compatibility. A fitting outline or similar three-wire cable does not settle these questions.</p><p><b>飞特HD-1910-C001是候选方案，不是已确认可直接替换的器件，也不是采购决定。</b>需要单独审查版本，验证安装孔、舵盘与间隙、供电、接头针序、总线协议和驱动、力矩速度与回差标定，以及行走策略适配。</p><p>The XL330 supply mismatch already identified in our cable guide remains unresolved. Changing brands does not by itself close the electrical or mechanical checks. 当前XL330供电矛盾仍未解决；换品牌本身不等于通过电气和机械验证。</p></div><h2>Evidence and exact versions / 证据与版本</h2><p><a href="VERSION COMPARISON.json">Local source hashes and comparison record / 本地来源哈希与比较记录</a>. The runtime and RL statements are supported by archived official READMEs, whose hashes are recorded; only commits actually recorded in the source manifests are claimed as pins.</p><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck">Official runtime / 官方运行时</a> and <a href="https://github.com/pollen-robotics/microduck_rl">official training repository / 官方训练仓库</a>.</li><li><a href="https://github.com/pollen-robotics/elec_RPI_Robot_HAT/tree/23eab11927f95ceca0dfa35bf182caeb7db39ea0">Official HAT pin / 官方HAT固定版本</a>.</li><li>'''
